<Styles xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

  <!-- Icon set + the flat icon-button look the player bar is built from.
       Geometry, not an icon font: glyph fonts differ per platform (and Linux
       has no Segoe), so paths keep the bar identical everywhere.

       Every path ends with two invisible sub-pixel squares at (0,0) and (24,24):
       PathIcon scales the geometry's *ink* bounds to the box, so without them the
       designed 24-grid padding is lost and each glyph stretches edge-to-edge —
       oversized, optically mismatched, and visually clipped by the hover pill.
       The anchors pin the bounds to the full grid. -->
